        dcterms:description "Deterministic RNG (`seed=1976`), standalone `--self-test` suite verifying SHA-256 dataset integrity, analytical wavelength and size invariance, bitwise two-run solver determinism (`atol=0.0`), <0.2% wavelength error, miniature embryo N_mini = N_norm = 40 invariance, clock-arrested N_null = 0 control, and specimen segmentation (`run_self_test`, L568-615), plus rendered PNG and GIF outputs in `docs/media/`." ;
